    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d213-a1-a2">

                <pb facs="0391" n="351" xml:id="pg351"/>

                <head>Earl Russell to Mr.
                        Adams</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foreign Office,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 28, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Earl Russell presents his compliments to Mr. Adams, and, in reply to his note of
                    the 25th instant, requests he will be so good as to send the letter therein
                    referred to to Lord Russell, in order that he may lay it before the Queen.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
